---
---
<section class="section" data-od-id="section-terms">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Service terms</span>
      <h2>Clear terms before you book</h2>
      <p>The essentials of how our rentals operate. Full terms available on request.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="terms-grid">
      <div class="term-card reveal" data-od-id="term-payment">
        <span class="tn">01 · Payment</span>
        <h4>Split payment, secured booking</h4>
        <div class="pay-split">
          <div class="seg"><div class="pct mono">70%</div><div class="lab">Booking fee — <span class="hl">12 hours</span> before event</div></div>
          <div class="seg"><div class="pct mono">30%</div><div class="lab">Remaining — before event start</div></div>
        </div>
        <ul style="margin-top:14px;">
          <li>Weekend / Public Holiday work: <span class="hl">+20%</span> surcharge applies</li>
          <li>Outside Klang Valley: transport by mileage; accommodation added if required</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="term-card reveal" data-od-id="term-rehearsal">
        <span class="tn">02 · Rehearsal</span>
        <h4>Day-before rehearsal</h4>
        <p>Rehearsals scheduled for the day before the event carry an additional <span class="hl">+50%</span> charge of the selected package.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="term-card reveal" data-od-id="term-cancellation">
        <span class="tn">03 · Cancellation</span>
        <h4>No refunds issued</h4>
        <p>Please note that there will be no refunds issued for any cancellations. We recommend confirming your schedule before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="term-card reveal" data-od-id="term-damage-availability">
        <span class="tn">04 · Damage & availability</span>
        <h4>Equipment care & booking ahead</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Any damages to items result in additional costs, borne by the client</li>
          <li>All teleprompters are subject to availability — book in advance to secure one</li>
          <li>TelePrompter.my reserves the right to withhold all products and services if payment is not received in full</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .terms-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .term-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; }
  .term-card .tn { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .8rem; color: var(--accent-bright); letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .term-card h4 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 10px 0 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .term-card p, .term-card li { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .term-card ul { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .term-card ul li { padding-left: 18px; position: relative; }
  .term-card ul li::before { content: "—"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent-bright); }
  .hl { color: var(--accent-bright); font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .pay-split { display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .pay-split .seg { flex: 1; }
  .pay-split .seg .pct { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-bright); }
  .pay-split .seg .lab { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .terms-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
